### Banking System API smoke tests
### Run the backend first on http://localhost:8080.
### Paste a JWT from the login response into @token.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### 1) Login (same endpoint for customer and admin)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sk.39648215@gmail.com",
  "password": "Sachin1301#"
}

### 2) Register a customer (automatically creates SAVINGS account)
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Customer",
  "email": "demo.customer@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "9999999999",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### 3) Current profile
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Current user's accounts
GET {{base}}/accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Deposit — replace account number
POST {{base}}/transactions/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC_REPLACE_ME",
  "amount": 5000
}

### 6) Withdraw
POST {{base}}/transactions/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC_REPLACE_ME",
  "amount": 500
}

### 7) Transfer — login as sender and replace both account numbers
POST {{base}}/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "ACC_SENDER",
  "toAccountNumber": "ACC_RECEIVER",
  "amount": 250
}

### 8) Sender/receiver account history
GET {{base}}/transactions/account/ACC_REPLACE_ME
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) Admin: all transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================
### EMAIL OTP TRANSACTIONS
### =========================
### 1) Log in as a USER and copy the JWT token into @userToken.
### 2) Configure MAIL_USERNAME and MAIL_APP_PASSWORD before testing.

@userToken = replace-with-user-jwt
@myAccount = ACC_REPLACE_ME
@recipientAccount = ACC_REPLACE_ME
@challengeId = replace-after-request

### Request deposit OTP (NO balance change yet)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "{{myAccount}}",
  "amount": 500
}

### Request withdrawal OTP (NO balance change yet)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "{{myAccount}}",
  "amount": 100
}

### Request transfer OTP (NO balance change yet)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "{{myAccount}}",
  "toAccountNumber": "{{recipientAccount}}",
  "amount": 50
}

### Verify OTP and execute the exact pending transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/otp/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challengeId": "{{challengeId}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}
